#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""git-create - a safe, menu-driven Git/GitHub project assistant.

Single-file application. Python 3.9+ and the standard library only.

The program deliberately avoids destructive Git operations:
- no force pushes,
- no automatic history rewriting,
- no automatic overwriting of project files,
- secret-looking tracked files are reported and blocked before commits.
"""

